      "text": "Reidemeister torsion on character varieties — 52 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Character varieties and Reidemeist\n\n**Reidemeister torsion on character varieties**\n\n*The documents may come from teaching and research*\n\n110 pp, 52 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 0 Introduction; 1 Character varieties and Reidemeister torsion; 1.1.1 Representation variety; 1.1.2 Algebro-geometric quotient; 1.1.3 Traces and skein algebra; 1.1.4 Characters, reducibility and irreducibil; 1.1.5 Saito’s Theorem and some consequences; 1.1.6 The augmented variety; 1.1.7 The tautological representation; 1.1.8 Examples; 1.2 Twisted cohomology; 1.3 Culler-Shalen theory, group acting on tree; 1.3.1 The tree; 1.3.2 Link of a vertex and ends of the tree; 1.3.3 The SL2 action : stabilizers of vertices; 1.3.4 Curves and valuations; 1.3.5 Group acting on a tree and splitting",
